omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HBurepqtyUEQ7kNvwGVvKi_&_nc_oc=AdqXcP9mxih71v2TcBwL_o48c-XP78E59hq6zlqiiJBT4YHcvu6daPlcAMq8oeHpnbQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af98V9TvF2MffaTYh1m88WgT3mT5zDYgB3DyRc9k6ZsSnA&oe=6A413C34"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ExV8BDTKVvcQ7kNvwEhnhe3&_nc_oc=AdorItWJcuHBfBG9zjZqZJ5U0cHMFOf8wktt41MZE2PebtzJg76_jqqteYQqsOCh3L8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8nJv-O9rikUqdlkfBpiHEuNJvpkx6bZMymGF1SzHlmxA&oe=6A413D96"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rzlw8tpTIE0Q7kNvwE3Xvcn&_nc_oc=Adq-FfEohUBhak8VvtyA5CxbwOcU6U_suqdbVvvIWKwrg6p-b5tbyeZkoEXhsPUlqIQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af92-r26Rrw1ifWayKYuM4bHOpS5Qub3E0SlInl-TFumkA&oe=6A411A77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://